			written = { ["Through town east to west: {npc:8962} and {npc:341} at the north end of the bridge, {npc:381} on the docks, then {npc:342}'s garden at the west end. Cross the long bridge north into town: {npc:8965} and {npc:8962} play by the shore at its north end, {npc:341} stands there too, {npc:415} by the smithy, {npc:344} in the town hall, {npc:381} on the docks, {npc:266} upstairs in the inn and {npc:379} and {npc:343} inside it."] = "Through town east to west: Hilary and Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, Dockmaster Baren on the docks, then Martie's garden at the west end. Cross the long bridge north into town: Shawn and Hilary play by the shore at its north end, Foreman Oslow stands there too, Verner Osgood by the smithy, Magistrate Solomon in the town hall, Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Wiley the Black upstairs in the inn and Darcy and Chef Breanna inside it." },
