					note = "The cultists fill the streets and fields of {area:16723}. Start at the ritual circles in the middle (fill Claire's catalyst there), work west through the burnt houses to the edge of town, then back north-east to the loose soil west of Elbrim's farm: bury the Farmers' Mementos the Twilight Raiders drop there. The charms, pages and finger bones drop from the cultists.\nKeep the {item:4338} they drop: Brother Lowley in {area:16724} asks for twenty when you are back there. Now and then a cultist drops the Field Marshal's Log: right-click it to start the quest.\nCareful: Chogg'Zac, an elite ogre (level 41), walks the western streets of {area:16723}, around 44-47,47-52. Pull the cultists out towards you and let him pass; players died here more than anywhere else in the zone.\nGhostmaw, the river's elite (level 42), can wander up from the south-western fields: let him pass.",
