			steps = {
				{
					title = "The Strange Orb",
					note = "Climb to the top of the {area:444} in northern {zone:1439}. The Dark Strand Fanatics around it are easy (level 16-17), but four Dark Strand Voidcallers (level 28-29) stand in the tower on the way to the orb: each calls a voidwalker and casts {spell:686} from range. At 22-25 bring a friend or two, pull them one at a time and step behind a wall so they have to come to you. Loot the Strange Orb at the top: it gives you the Althalaxx Orb; right-click it to start the quest. Keep the orb in your bags until the {object:409311}: three later quests need it.",
