					},
				},
				{
					title = "The north end of the {area:414}",
					note = "The naga's flooded ruins lie just past the north end of the {area:414}, south of {zone:1439} along the coast. The arrow cannot find its own way down into them, so it leads you to the water's edge first: from there swim north into the ruins.",
					goals = {
