					note = "{spell:1299382} come from battlegrounds, PvP quests and the season's weekly tasks, with a weekly cap; Commander (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. The Player vs. Player tab of your character pane shows your rank and what you may buy. {skill:762} one at full speed needs Journeyman {skill:762} (level 60). Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 60 and Journeyman {skill:762}.",
